体力気をつけて。どうした？体力大丈夫？
Take care of your stamina. What's wrong? Is your stamina okay?

320
00:21:38,032 --> 00:21:40,532
体力気をつけて。まだあるよ、まだあるよ。
Take care of your stamina. There's still more, there's still more.

321
00:21:40,532 --> 00:21:42,532
意外と痛い。まだあるぞ。
Surprisingly painful. There's still more.

322
00:21:42,532 --> 00:21:46,032
