When you say "this", there's something that becomes "this".

332
00:22:46,032 --> 00:22:49,032
なんただ、わからないな。なんだなんだ？フルクラ。
I don't know. What is it? Full-cla?

333
00:22:50,032 --> 00:22:53,032
いや、この前やったの、そうなん。やったよ。そうなのだよ。
No, we did it the other day, that's right. We did it. That's right.

334
00:22:53,532 --> 00:22:56,532
やってちゃったね。メルクラは、やった？初めてだよね。
We did it. Did we do Mel-cla? It's our first time, right?

335
00:22:56,532 --> 00:23:00,032
